ze:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Talent Acquisition Manager<br>Human Resources </span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Marisa Gibaud &lt;marisa.gibaud@tidalhealth.org&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Thursday, March 26, 2026 11:41 AM<br><b>To:</b> Jim Kanuch &lt;Jim.Kanuch@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Nikki Merchant &lt;Nikki.Merchant@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Filippa Etherton &lt;Filippa.Etherton@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Erin Cowder &lt;Erin.Cowder@tidalhealth.org&gt;; Kristen Hager &lt;Kristen.Hager@tidalhealth.org&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> New Position - JC1317 Provider Pay Administrator</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Hello team!</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">A new position has been created and approved to be created. Please see position info below. <a id=\"OWAAM807391B04FD84D2F9789DE59CF342263\" href=\"mailto:Jim.Kanuch@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Jim Kanuch</span></a> If there are any more changes to the position description information listed below, please let us know so we can adjust as needed.</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Reason:</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:38.25pt; text-indent:-.25in\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Symbol\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">·<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Reclassification of a current team member </p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Please let us know if there are any questions, we are happy to help.</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Title: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Provider Pay Administrator</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>PL/CC/JC</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>13/9013/1317</b></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:16.55pt\"><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Grade: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height:16.55pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">21</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Salary Range:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">$58,781-$91,125</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FLSA: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Exempt</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>License: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">None</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FTE Leader:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">No</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Direct Supervision: </b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">None</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>FTE Hours:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">1.00</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Reports to:</b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Finance Manager for Medical Partners</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Job Description Status:</b> </p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"xmsonormal\">In progress, information below</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Position Summary:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Supports the effective operation of the Medical Partners organization through coordination of budgeting and financial planning, administration of provider pay and tracking of provider agreements, and support for special operational projects. This role works closely with senior staff and Medical Directors to translate approved provider agreements into operational pay setups, identify and resolve implementation issues, and support annual budgeting and planning activities. </li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in\"><b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Education:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business, or a related field is required.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;</b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Experience:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Five (5) years of relevant work experience in healthcare or similar fields.</li><li class=\"xmsolistparagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\">Experience in healthcare finance, provider operations, or contract tracking strongly preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b>Schedule:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</li><li class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</li></ul><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><a id=\"OWAAM042AF5AD606245A58AC207B455758B64\" href=\"mailto:Nikki.Merchant@tidalhealth.org\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@Nikki Merchant</span></a> - </span>please pass this along to the correct TA partner.&nbsp; We have done the salary calcs already so hopefully this is a quick lift!<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Thanks,</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><i>&nbsp;</i></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></body></html>"}